Grant the M7 logical machine (LMM_1) full state-change rights (ALL instead
of NOTIFY-only) and add TRDC access grants for the M7MIX bus and the
0x90000000-0x914FFFFF M7 DDR window (MCUboot + primary + staging slots),
needed for the M7 to run from DDR. The AP (Linux) is granted read-only
access to the MCUboot and primary-slot regions, and read-write access to
the staging slot only, so Linux can write firmware updates to staging
without being able to touch MCUboot or the primary slot.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific configuration]

